        "data": {
          "comment": "# Comfy ACE-Step 1.5 XL Turbo\n\nGenerate audio on Comfy Cloud with the official ACE-Step 1.5 XL Turbo template. Requires COMFY_API_KEY and model availability on Comfy Cloud.\n\n**How it works:** The Comfy nodes form the complete ACE-Step 1.5 XL Turbo graph. Run submits the graph to Comfy Cloud and saves its generated audio.\n\n**Try this:** Change tags on TextEncodeAceStepAudio1.5 and run again to compare results. Edit the visible nodes to change settings, lyrics or duration.\n\nSource: https://github.com/Comfy-Org/workflow_templates/blob/1ae390968e323dba24a6991d1860ded051f5a79b/benchmarks/audio_ace_step1_5_xl_turbo.json (MIT). Model licenses apply separately."
